o the secondary server at regular intervals, which means that there are times when both servers do not contain the exact same data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="559852">warm standby</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2223433">ыстық резервтеу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11879_439106_615056"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A version of the integrated system of Microsoft core desktop productivity tools, programs, servers, and services designed for information work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="439106">2007 Microsoft® Office system</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615056">2007 Microsoft® Office жүйесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1188_180502_2203876"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of putting string or character literals in the main body of code, instead of in external resource files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="180502">hard-coding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2203876">қатты кодталған</term><termNote type="geographi