 marketable form.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="50960">end user</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626585">соңғы пайдаланушы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13224_138502_2098788"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A reference to a specific legal case, statute, or other legal document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="138502">citation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2098788">сілтеме</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13228_263086_626359"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person who is involved in the creation of content. For example editors, technical reviewers and subject matter experts are contributors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="263086">contributor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626359">қатысушы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13233_372513_615314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of space from the bottom of one line of text to the bottom of the next line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="372513">leading</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615314">аралық</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13233_372513_615317"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of space from the bottom of one line of text to the bottom of the next line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="372513">leading</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615317">жол аралығы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13233_75157_615314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of space from the bottom of one line of text to the bottom of the next line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="75157">line spacing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615314">аралық</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mas