Selected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626463">сандық</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14242_180794_2199997"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The movement of data through a group of connected elements that extract, transform, and load data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="180794">data flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2199997">деректер ағыны</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14244_115576_2780889"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make a transmission appear to come from a user other than the user who performed the action.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="115576">spoof</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2780889">қолдан жасау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14244_115576_407645"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make a transmission appear to come from a user other than the user who performed the action.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="115576">spoof</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="407645">айла</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14245_294303_1305843"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A defined set of application access privileges. The security role assigned to a user determines which tasks the user can perform and which parts of the user interface the user can view. All users must be assigned at least one security role in order to access the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="294303">security role</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1305843">қауіпсіздік рөлі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14246_343618_1250182"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A diagramming capability that shows charts in three dimensions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="343618">3-D effect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250182">үш өлшемдік әсер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</te