 new email messages, Calendar, Contacts, and Tasks notifications from the server to the device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="358355">Direct Push</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="362290">Тікелей жылжыту</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14585_329892_625988"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A change to an account to correct or update the balance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="329892">adjustment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="625988">түзету</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14587_373354_639496"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A keyword that is associated with one or more subordinate keywords.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="373354">parent keyword</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="639496">тектік кілт сөз</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14591_373954_615444"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field data type that automatically stores a unique number for each record as it's added to a table.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="373954">AutoNumber</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615444">автосанағыш</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14592_168825_2177416"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A data backup of a database or files upon which a differential backup is fully or partially based. The base backup is the most recent full or file backup of the database or files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="168825">base backup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2177416">базалық резервтік көшірме</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14594_185887_1332823"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button in the Options dialog box, on the Phones tab, that the user clicks to enter his or her mobile phone number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="185887">Mobile Phone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1332823">ұялы телефон</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14595_418616_1331106"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The server through which Communicator connects with other users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="418616">communications server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1331106">байланыс сервері</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14596_557760_1030722"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A role that consists of the services that are used to process data. To run Microsoft Dynamics CRM, you must have at least one computer that is running the Platform Server role.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="557760">Platform Server Role</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1030722">Платформа серверінің рөлі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14605_42779_2200046"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of identifying commercially useful patterns or relationships in databases or other computer repositories through the use of advanced statistical tools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="42779">data mining</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2200046">деректерді интеллектуалды талдау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14606_211370_626549"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The date by which some task or action should be completed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="211370">due date</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626549">мерзім</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14608_535217_2212583"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A modeling concept that describes how interface members are mapped from one interface to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="535217">member delegation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2212583">элементтерді беру</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14609_183539_2463723"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An artificial intelligence program that performs a task on a network as an agent for a user or another program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="183539">bot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2463723">бот</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14609_183540_2463723"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An artificial intelligence program that performs a task on a network as an agent for a user or another program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="183540">robot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2463723">бот</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14610_25574_626176"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A graphic element that appears similar to a physical button or keyboard key in the UI. A button is "pressed" by clicking on it with a mouse, by hitting ENTER or RETURN on the keyboard (if the button has the focus) or tapping by a finger.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25574">button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><nti