 in some programming languages. For example, the expression 3^2 represents the number 3 raised to the second power.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="304427">caret</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250197">қақпақ белгісі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15154_2421378_1598546"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A work item that records a possible event with an undesirable outcome.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2421378">risk event</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1598546">қауіп</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15154_2421378_2422370"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A work item that records a possible event with an undesirable outcome.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2421378">risk event</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2422370">қауіп оқиғасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15154_252099_1598546"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A work item that records a possible event with an undesirable outcome.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="252099">risk</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1598546">қауіп</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15154_252099_2422370"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A work item that records a possible event with an undesirable outcome.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="252099">risk</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2422370">қауіп оқиғасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15155_415074_2201078"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The dimension member used in a query when no member is specified for the dimension.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="415074">default member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2201078">әдепкі элемент</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15161_234965_1305834"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A span of time during which the financial activities of an organization are calculated. A fiscal year is divided into fiscal periods, typically defined as semesters, quarters, or months. The organization determines the dates that begin and end its fiscal year, which may not correspond to a traditional calendar year.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234965">fiscal year</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1305834">қаржы жылы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15169_237946_2101526"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A guide consisting of two short, intersecting lines that can be placed anywhere on a drawing page or on a shape.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237946">guide point</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2101526">бағыттаушы нүкте</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15171_460668_1030635"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A report in the Microsoft Dynamics CRM user interface that provides a table showing each competitor, the number of open opportunities and closed opportunities against each competitor, and the percentage and ratio of won and lost opportunities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="460668">Competitor Win Loss</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1030635">Бәсеке жағдайындағы ұту және шығындану</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15172_30240_2101527"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An integer that corresponds to an open dynamic data exchange (DDE) channel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30240">channel number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2101527">арна нөмірі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15173_233319_638309"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An estimate of sales revenue that typically spans a specific period such as a month, quarter of a year, one half of a year, or a full year.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233319">sales forecast</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="638309">сату болжамы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15174_169024_2206489"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In a media set using tape backup devices, the first tape in a media family.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169024">initial tape</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2206489">бастапқы таспа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15181_84318_2101528"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A link between a user's computer and a group of computers and other devices that enables the user to access printers, servers etc. The link can be through a wire, cable, phone line or wireless transmissions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="84318">network connection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2101528">желілік байланыс</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15183_3230_2101529"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of or relating to a time frame imposed by external constraints. Real-time operations are those in which the computer's activities match the human perception of time or those in which computer operations proceed at the same rate as a physical or external process. Real-time operations are characteristic of aircraft guidance systems, transaction-processing systems, scientific applications, and other areas in which a computer must respond to situations as they occur (for example, animating a graphic in a flight simulator or making corrections based on measurements).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3230">real-time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2101529">нақты уақыт</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15184_181564_2219581"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The blueprint for a report before the report is processed or rendered. A report definition contains information about the query and layout for the report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="181564">report definition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2219581">есеп анықтамасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15190_235033_626801"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A device that creates or initiates requests or events.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="235033">initiator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626801">бастаушы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15191_232512_2101530"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The modification of a process or task to improve performance to meet an established standard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232512">performance management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2101530">өнімділікті басқару</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15201_36468_2269565"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a product that can work with or is equivalent to another product.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="36468">compatible</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2269565">үйлесімді</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15206_537721_1778950"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A specific version policy that requests a given assembly be run with the exact version of its dependencies that it was compiled against.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="537721">safe mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1778950">қауіпсіз режим</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15209_19668_626105"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The data transfer capacity (speed of transmission) of a digital communications system as measured in bits per second (bps).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="19668">bandwidth</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626105">өткізу мүмкіндігі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15213_42874_2200158"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A known data source specific to a target type that provides data to a collector type.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="42874">data provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2200158">деректерді жеткізуші</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15215_530795_2221489"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of five databases present in all instances of SQL Server that are used to store system information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="530795">system databases</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2221489">жүйе дерекқорлары</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15222_211310_2340621"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A randomly generated ID that is associated with a message and passed along for the lifetime of a given message. It is used to string up all the different page views in a session so developers can understand the customer's full experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="211310">correlation ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340621">өзара қатынас идентификаторы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15226_115145_1145243"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In information processing, a description of the data records, programs, and procedures involved in a particular task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="115145">specification</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1145243">сипаттама</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15226_684500_1145243"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In information processing, a description of the data records, programs, and procedures involved in a particular task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="684500">spec</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1145243">сипаттама</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15227_182208_2203021"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">UI text for subscriptions and HTML viewer. Corresponds to rendering extensions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="182208">export format</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2203021">экспорт пішімі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15232_31750_1490853"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A universally unique identifier (UUID) that identifies a COM component. Each COM component has its CLSID in the Windows r