ening. For example, sale being made.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="178822">probability</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="638281">ықтималдық</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15377_233257_1030598"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A single item with an item number that consists of one or more component items from inventory or a product catalog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233257">kit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1030598">жинақ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15377_233294_1030598"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A single item with an item number that consists of one or more component items from inventory or a product catalog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233294">kit item</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1030598">жинақ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15381_431811_2779500"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The use of audio, video, or computer equipment linked through a communications system to enable geographically separated individuals to participate in a meeting or discussion.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="431811">teleconferencing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2779500">телеконференция</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15383_2482719_2486245"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The primary circuit board in a computer that contains most of the basic components of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2482719">baseboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2486245">жүйелік тақта</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15383_81653_2486245"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The primary circuit board in a computer that contains most of the basic components of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81653">motherboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2486245">жүйелік тақта</term><termNo