sed to break a word between syllables at the end of a line or to separate the parts of a compound word.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319136">HYPHEN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626767">сызықшық</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15886_63086_626767"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ‐ character, used to break a word between syllables at the end of a line or to separate the parts of a compound word.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="63086">hyphen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626767">сызықшық</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15888_62684_3041724"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A color model used in some graphics programs to define a color by three values: Hue, the color itself; Saturation, the purity of the color; and Value, the lightness or darkness of a color.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="62684">HSV</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3041724">HSV</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote typ