ble without the decryption key.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="641218">128-bit encryption</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2101640">128 биттік шифрлау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17394_642189_2101641"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A database that stores service information for each portal site in a deployment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="642189">component settings database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2101641">компоненттер параметрлерінің дерекқоры</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17396_1104211_1346470"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A program whose function is to install another program, either on a storage medium or in memory. An installation program, also called a setup program, might be used to guide a user through the often complex process of setting up an application for a particular combination of machine, printer, and monitor.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1104211">setup program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1346470">Орнату бағдарламасы</term><term