 on most digital cameras that lets you control the under -or over- exposure of the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="686810">exposure bias compensation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="723849">экспозицияның компенсациясы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19723_686811_723849"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control on most digital cameras that lets you control the under -or over- exposure of the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="686811">exposure compensation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="723849">экспозицияның компенсациясы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19746_674461_1145240"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rectangular selection including active layers and effects on the workspace that can be exported.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="674461">slice</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1145240">бөлік</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote 