ngs and events from left to right on a time scale and that can incorporate items from multiple calendars.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149214">timeline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250029">уақыт шкаласы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20770_747437_757880"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A contact within a group in the Contacts list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747437">group member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="757880">топ мүшесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20771_747438_757881"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A video stream from a source that is external to the user's computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747438">incoming video</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="757881">кіріс бейне</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20772_747440_757882"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The large video feed in a conversation window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747440">main video</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="757882">негізгі бейне</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2078_791_2070171"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component of the notice principle, wherein a company should make available its data handling practices, including notices on how it collects, uses, and shares PII.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="791">disclosure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2070171">жариялау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20781_747562_2843451"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In a call queue, a method of sending calls to agents whereby incoming calls ring all call agents one by one, from the beginning of the call agent list. If an agent dismisses or does not pick up a call, the call will ring the next agent and will try all agents until it is picked up or times out.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747562">serial routing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><