 or video file that you rent from an online store, typically for a monthly fee.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1045759">subscription file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250360">жазылу файлы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22492_1045783_1250361"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A troubleshooter that performs common maintenance tasks in Windows, such as cleaning up unused files and shortcuts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1045783">Maintenance troubleshooter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250361">қызмет көрсету ақауларды жою құралы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22493_1045790_1250362"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A troubleshooter that helps find and fix problems about hardware and devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1045790">Hardware and Devices troubleshooter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250362">аппараттық құралдар мен құрылғылардың ақауларын жою құралы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2250_527637_1802627"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a process, tool, etc. that is enabled by Windows Live.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="527637">powered by Windows Live</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1802627">Windows Live бағдарламасының негізінде</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22509_1047681_1250363"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A search location exposed via .osdx templates and made possible via the OpenSearch technology. It connects the local search indexer to a remote index and provides the end user with the ability to search for files on a Web site or on an intranet site from within Windows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1047681">search connector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250363">іздеу коннекторы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22516_1047720_1697385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web site from Microsoft which provides solutions for the top issues about Windows Update or Microsoft Update, and enables you to contact a support professional.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1047720">Microsoft Update Solution Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1697385">Microsoft Update шешім орталығы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2252_163636_626991"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A network-enabled host running Simple Network Management Protocol (SNMP) management software. This software requests information from SNMP agents.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="163636">management console</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626991">басқару консолі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2252_163636_626992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A network-enabled host running Simple Network Management Protocol (SNMP) management software. This software requests information from SNMP agents.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="163636">management console</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626992">басқару жүйесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">