ed</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23331_1073321_1249270"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A slide show mode that displays content in a manageable window that can be resized and features navigation buttons. This mode is optimized for reviewing presentations, allowing users to get the full experience, complete with animations and media, while performing other tasks, such as taking notes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1073321">Reading View</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1249270">оқу көрінісі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23333_1087526_1091109"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows users to easily add links to content within other content (e.g. pages, sections, section groups) and provides quick navigation through these links. The feature operates in the same manner that links work in wikis.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1087526">linking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091109">сілтемелер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23334_1073349_1084015"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that highlights new or changed content in a shared notebook that the user has not yet read.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1073349">Unread Changes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1084015">оқылмаған өзгертулер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23335_1073356_1084014"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A high-level linear representation of a project schedule that can be easily formatted, annotated, and copied and pasted from Project into other Office applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1073356">timeline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1084014">уақыт шкаласы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23336_1073640_1083990"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that identifies the author of unread new or changed content in a shared notebook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1073640">Author Marks</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1083990">автордың белгілері</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23347_1074772_1084009"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A task pane that helps form designers to build and manage custom business rules for use in their forms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074772">Rules Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1084009">ережелер реттеушісі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23348_1074773_1083998"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pre-defined table style that allows users to change the look and feel of a form.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074773">layout style</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1083998">орналасу мәнері</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23349_1074775_1084004"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows form designers to select from a gallery of pre-built rules to make their forms dynamic.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074775">Quick Rules</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1084004">жылдам ережелер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23350_1074777_1084001"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pre-defined layout that users can select for their InfoPath form pages. Options include layouts with titles, titles and headings, titles, headings and subheadings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074777">page layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1084001">беттің орналасуы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23351_1074778_1084010"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pre-defined layout that users can select for their InfoPath form sections. Options include single column, two-column, three-column, and four-column layouts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074778">section layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1084010">бөлім орналасуы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23355_1074783_1083991"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web Part that implements Web chart controls to visually display information in a variety of chart types in SharePoint.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074783">Chart Web Part</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1083991">диаграмманың веб-бөлігі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23358_1074794_2105066"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of processors commonly used for low-powered hardware, such as tablets and other mobile devices. These small, high-performance 32-bit RISC-based microprocessors are licensed to various semiconductor manufacturers by designer ARM Limited.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074794">ARM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105066">ARM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23361_1074891_2079152"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The combination of hardware (touchscreen or touchpad) and software elements that provides a way to control programs by touching multiple points on the screen simultaneously.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1074891">multi-touch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2079152">мультисенсор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23377_1075958_1091110"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system table that captures failures and other events for Access Services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1075958">logging table</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091110">журнал кестесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23378_1076012_2105067"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hard-coded number whose digits give no indication as to what the number represents.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1076012">magic number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105067">сиқырлы сан</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23379_1076039_1091123"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of features designed to improve Groove's communications infrastructure and routing model in order to increase efficiency and performance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><t