es as an interface between the user and the browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275547">browser window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1984920">браузер терезесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26511_1275548_2105089"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A role group that ships by default as opposed to a customized role group that a admin would customize specifically for the needs of their organization</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275548">built-in role group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105089">бекітілген рөлдер тобы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26513_1275552_1985179"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Identity Lifecycle Management (ILM) component that consists of properties, rules, and rule extensions that determine how an object is processed and that provides services to client computers or organizations that connect from remote locations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275552">hosted management agent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1985179">орналастырылған басқару агенті</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26514_1275570_1319944"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tooltip for the Close button.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275570">Close</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1319944">Жабу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26515_1275576_1985198"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An instance of a multi-mailbox search.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275576">mailbox search</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1985198">пошта жәшігінде іздеу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2652_169087_2221215"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A media set that uses multiple devices, among which each backup is distributed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169087">striped media set</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSe