ail Options section of the user's mailbox in the Web management interface for Outlook Live.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275652">primary e-mail address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1985274">бастапқы электрондық пошта мекенжайы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26526_1275654_1985277"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object that represents a user or resource in Outlook, generally a mail message addressee.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275654">recipient object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1985277">алушы нысаны</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26527_1275656_1985279"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The domain that an administrator has registered with a domain registrar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275656">registered domain</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1985279">тіркелген домен</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26529_1275659_1985293"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process by which a user presses and holds a key on their mobile phone keypad to dial a specific phone number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275659">speed dialing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1985293">жылдам теру</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26530_1275661_1985157"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The settings, related to the domain, a user needs to configure to get messaging up and running.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275661">domain settings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1985157">домен параметрлері</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26531_1275663_1320275"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To transfer a call to a holding point instead of holding the call at the phone device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275663">park</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1320275">күту күйіне қою</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26535_1275693_1320309"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To answer a call by dialing the associated number on the network where it has been parked.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275693">retrieve</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1320309">жауап беру</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26536_1275694_1764841"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that transfers a call back to the person who parked it, after a specified amount of time, so a caller doesn't remain on hold indefinitely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275694">ringback</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1764841">кезектегі абонентке қосу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26536_1275694_2105090"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that transfers a call back to the person who parked it, after a specified amount of time, so a caller doesn't remain on hold indefinitely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275694">ringback</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105090">қайта қоңырау шалу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26537_1275696_1320272"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number assigned to a parked call by the call park server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275696">orbit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1320272">орбита</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26538_1275697_1320305"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An additional phone number with a distinct ring tone that cannot be forwarded. A private line allows a person who delegates calls to have a direct, confidential line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275697">private line</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1320305">жеке желі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26539_1275698_1320050"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A microphone and speaker combination configured by the user in Lync and Office Communicator.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275698">custom device</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1320050">қолданбалы құрылғы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26545_1275963_1320279"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option on the Transfer button that lets you park a call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275963">Parking Lot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1320279">Күту күйіне қою орны</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26546_1275964_1320170"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables phone users to report disturbing calls to the system administrator. When the user selects to report a malicious call, data from the last call received is captured and sent to the system administrator.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275964">malicious call reporting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1320170">Арам ниетті қоңырау туралы есеп</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26549_1275967_2727668"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The client-side SharePoint Server control that allows users to search for and select valid user accounts for people, groups, and claims in their organization to grant permission to items such as lists, libraries, or SharePoint sites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275967">People Picker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2727668">адамдарды таңдау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26558_1276179_2052351"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of Human Interaction Proof challenge, which plays an audio file decipherable only by a person. The audio file might seem faint or mixed with background voices and noise. This is intentional to ensure a person, not an automated program, completes the HIP challenge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1276179">audio challenge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2052351">дыбыстық тексеріс</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammati