otSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1484852_2727698"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484852">SharePoint Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2727698">SDPS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1484852_2727699"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484852">SharePoint Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2727699">SharePoint бағдарламасын орналастыруды жоспарлау бойынша қызметтер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1673938_2727698"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673938">SDPS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2727698">SDPS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1673938_2727699"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673938">SDPS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2727699">SharePoint бағдарламасын орналастыруды жоспарлау бойынша қызметтер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28406_1484854_2727628"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Software Assurance benefit delivered by Microsoft Certified Partner that consists of one to fifteen days of planning the deployment of Microsoft Office Software for a specific organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484854">Microsoft Desktop Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2727628">Microsoft жүйелерін орналастыруды жоспарлау бойынша қызметтер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28423_1486587_2214614"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SQL Server database that stores database settings and metadata with the instance of SQL Server Database Engine where the database is installed, and requires logins in the master database for authentication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1486587">non-contained database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2214614">дербес емес дерекқор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28424_1486589_2195992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SQL Server database that includes all of the user authentication, database settings, and metadata required to define and access the database, and has no configuration dependencies on the instance of the SQL Server Database Engine where the database is installed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1486589">contained database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2195992">дербес дерекқор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28426_1486692_2220168"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity that represents a service at the Key Distribution Center (KDC). The service principal has a name and an associated key. A subclass of principal, a service principal generally does not correspond to a human user of the system, but rather to an automated service providing a resource, such as a file server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1486692">service principal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2220168">субъект-қызмет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28430_1487165_2216760"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The layer in a map report that displays spatial data as points, for examples, points that indicate cities or points of interest.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487165">point layer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2216760">нүктелер қабаты</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28431_1487166_2216852"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The layer in a map report that displays spatial data as areas, for example, areas that indicate geographical regions such as counties.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487166">polygon layer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2216852">полигондар қабаты</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28432_1487167_2216762"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A needle, marker, or bar that indicates a single value displayed against a scale on a report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487167">pointer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2216762">көрсеткіш</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28434_1487371_2105101"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The year 2011 edition of Microsoft Office that runs on the Mac operating system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487371">Microsoft Office for Mac 2011</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105101">Mac 2011 жүйесіне арналған Microsoft Office</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28434_2170107_2105101"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The year 2011 edition of Microsoft Office that runs on the Mac operating system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2170107">Office for Mac 2011</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105101">Mac 2011 жүйесіне арналған Microsoft Office</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28435_1487377_2215396"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To rotate a table-valued expression by turning the unique values from one column in the expression into multiple columns in the output, and perform aggregations where they are required on any remaining column values that are wanted in the final output.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487377">pivot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2215396">жиынтық</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28436_1487678_1491523"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual representation such as a picture, chart or table.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1487678">graphic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1491523">сызба</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2845_535392_2221224"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A database at the Subscriber that receives data and database objects published by a Publisher.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="535392">subscription database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2221224">жазылым дерекқоры</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28459_1488400_2001512"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To convert a nested structure into a flat structure.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1488400">flatten</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2001512">туралау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2846_297003_2718468"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A trojan that captures and/or transmits passwords to an attacker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="297003">password stealer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2718468">құпиясөздерді ұрлау бағдарламасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2846_297003_627185"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A trojan that captures and/or transmits passwords to an attacker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="297003">password stealer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="627185">құпия сөздерді ұрлау бағдарламасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28462_1488403_1985191"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows the preservation of items in user mailboxes and the protection of the items from deletion by users or automated processes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1488403">Litigation Hold</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1985191">сот процесі үшін сақтау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28541_1489075_1746764"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service under which customers can acquire and redeem points for certain online services and digital products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1489075">Microsoft Points</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1746764">Microsoft Points</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28582_1489585_1782106"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To physically remove a cached object from the memory of the cache host or hosts that it is stored on. This is typically done to keep the memory usage of the cache host service in check.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1489585">evict</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1782106">алып тастау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28583_1489587_2203172"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows NT lightweight thread scheduled within a single OS thread.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1489587">fiber</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2203172">талшық</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2859_81048_1778448"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An operating mode setting that allows interoperability between versions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81048">mixed mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1778448">Аралас режим</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28593_1489612_2079153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process of repeated installation of a product, feature, tool, kit, pack, etc.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1489612">reinstallation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2079153">қайта орнату</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="286_157947_2070081"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">On Windows-based computers, a user account that is a member of the computer’s local Administrators group or a member of a group that is a member of the local Administrators group, such as the Domain Admins group in a Windows domain. This is the first account that is created when you install an operating system on a new workstation, stand-alone server, or member server. By default, this account has the highest level of administrative access to the local computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="157947">administrator account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2070081">әкімші тіркелгісі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="286_616490_2070081"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">On Windows-based computers, a user account that is a member of the computer’s local Administrators group or a member of a group that is a member of the local Administrators group, such as the Domain Admins group in a Windows domain. This is the first account that is created when you install an operating system on a new workstation, stand-alone server, or member server. By default, this account has the highest level of administrative access to the local computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="616490">administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2070081">әкімші тіркелгісі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="286_624589_2070081"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">On Windows-based computers, a user account that is a member of the computer’s local Administrators group or a member of a group that is a member of the local Administrators group, such as the Domain Admins group in a Windows domain. This is the first account that is created when you install an operating system on a new workstation, stand-alone server, or member server. By default, this account has the highest level of administrative access to the local computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="624589">built-in administrator account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2070081">әкімші тіркелгісі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="286_624618_2070081"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">On Windows-based computers, a user account that is a member of the computer’s local Administrators group or a member of a group that is a member of the local Administrators group, such as the Domain Admins group in a Windows domain. This is the first account that is created when you install an operating system on a new workstation, stand-alone server, or member server. By default, this account has the highest level of administrative access to the local computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="624618">built-in administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2070081">әкімші тіркелгісі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28619_1489914_1839140"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a request for payment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1489914">billing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1839140">есепшот</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2865_19878_615781"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The special identification code printed as a set of vertical bars of differing widths on books, grocery products, and other merchandise. Used for rapid, error-free input in such facilities as libraries, hospitals, and grocery stores, bar codes represent binary information that can be read by an optical scanner. The coding can include numbers, letters, or a combination of the two; some codes include built-in error checking and can be read in either direction.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="19878">bar code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615781">штрихкод</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2865_237346_615781"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The special identification code printed as a set of vertical bars of differing widths on books, grocery products, and other merchandise. Used for rapid, error-free input in such facilities as libraries, hospitals, and grocery stores, bar codes represent binary information that can be read by an optical scanner. The coding can include numbers, letters, or a combination of the two; some codes include built-in error checking and can be read in either direction.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237346">barcode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615781">штрихкод</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28664_1490062_1615173"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An offer from Microsoft Office 365 designed for small businesses (fewer than 25 users) and professionals that need anywhere access to email and documents with Office Web Apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1490062">Microsoft Office 365 (Plan P1)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1615173">Microsoft Office 365 (P1-жоспары)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28665_1490064_1615201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A 30-day free trial from Microsoft Office 365 designed for small businesses (fewer than 25 users) and professionals that need anywhere access to email and documents with Office Web Apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1490064">Microsoft Office 365 Trial (Plan P1)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1615201">Microsoft Office 365 сынақ нұсқасы (P1-жоспары)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28667_1490066_1615172"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An offer from Microsoft Office 365 designed for people in your business without a dedicated PC that need occasional access to web email and internal sites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1490066">Microsoft Office 365 (Plan K2)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1615172">Microsoft Office 365 (K2-жоспары)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28668_1490070_1615192"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A 30-day free trial from Microsoft Office 365 designed for people without a dedicated PC that need occasional access to web email, internal sites, and documents with Office Web Apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1490070">Microsoft Office 365 Trial (Plan K2)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1