">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29403_1507595_2220256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technique for partitioning large data sets, which improves performance and scalability, and enables distributed querying of data across multiple tenants.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507595">sharding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2220256">бөлшектеу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29407_1507599_2105103"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The server component of Analysis Services that is specifically designed to create and maintain multidimensional data structures and provide multidimensional data in response to client queries.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507599">Analysis Server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105103">деректерді талдау сервері</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29425_1507983_2200344"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A role within an organization responsible for the management and proficiency of data stored in an organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507983">data steward</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech"