hich administrators and partners purchase and manage Office 365 services and where users access and use Office 365 collaborative tools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1509439">Microsoft Office 365 portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1615188">Microsoft Office 365 порталы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2961_234789_627421"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A photographic style and filter name that renders a photo in brown tones, mimicking the old-fashioned look of photos taken in the early part of the 20th century.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234789">Sepia</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="627421">Cепия</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29610_2043185_2045974"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An offer for members of the Microsoft Partner Network who have the Microsoft Cloud Essentials Pack that provides a limited amount of the Microsoft Azure platform at no charge each month. The subscription includes a base level of monthly compute hours, storage, data transfers, a SQL Azure database, Access Control transactions, and Service Bus connections at no charge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2043185