calUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31589_1606737_2221144"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service that permits Windows backup programs to copy SQL Server data files through the Volume Shadow Copy Service framework, while SQL Server is running.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1606737">SQL Writer Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2221144">SQL жазу модулі қызметі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31590_1606738_2213106"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A wizard that supports the capture of information about an event for later analysis.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1606738">Microsoft SQL Server Playback Capture Wizard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2213106">Microsoft SQL Server Playback Capture Wizard</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31592_1608135_1655100"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that audibly reads the text on the screen aloud and describes some events to users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608135">Narrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1655100">Экрандық диктор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="316_137462_2070083"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A machine-wide code cache used for side-by-side storage of assemblies. There are two parts to the cache: the global assembly cache contains assemblies that are explicitly installed to be shared among many applications on the computer; the download cache stores code downloaded from Internet or intranet sites, isolated to the application that triggered the download so that code downloaded on behalf of one application/page does not impact other applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="137462">assembly cache</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2070083">жинау кэші</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31621_1608186_1674643"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables single-click access to trend and contribution patterns within a PivotTable or PivotChart report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608186">Quick Explore</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1674643">Жылдам зерттеу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31622_1608188_1674833"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">​A Web Part that combines a search list of projects in a site collection along with a timeline that shows how those projects relate to one another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608188">Team Work Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1674833">Топтық жұмыс орталығы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31623_1608189_1674850"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of variants on a single theme.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608189">theme family</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1674850">тақырыптар жиынтығы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31624_1608190_2221107"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SQL Server 