l device that interacts with an NFC-enabled phone. These devices exchange data, such as contact details or secure payment information, with NFC-enabled phones through contactless communication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1803761">NFC reader</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1839262">NFC оқу құралы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33607_1803831_1839263"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An exchange of information between two devices using NFC, or near field communication. Using NFC transactions, a person can use their phone to make payments in a store or as a bus pass.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1803831">NFC transaction</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1839263">NFC транзакциясы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33608_1803832_1839269"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The data limit plan where users purchase upfront a quota of data for a given time. For instance, pre-paid 500MB which expire in 6 months.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1803832">One time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1839269">бір рет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33609_1803833_1839274"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To navigate through screens or menus at a controlled rate, performed by putting your finger(s) on and keeping contact with the phone's touch screen while moving it around.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1803833">pan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1839274">жылжыту</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3361_181208_2214306"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Set of system functions in 32-bit Windows containing information that is based on language and cultural conventions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="181208">national language support API</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2214306">көп тілді қолдау API</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3361_181208_2214584"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Set of system functions in 32-