ically highlights the section they are in.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2012915">Contents</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2018754">Мазмұны</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34751_2012916_2018757"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI element that enables the user to locate text and go to locations where the text occurs in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2012916">Find</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2018757">Табу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34752_2012917_2015044"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove something from one's Favorites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2012917">unfavorite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2015044">таңдаулылардан жою</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34752_2793319_2015044"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove something from one's Favorites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2793319">remove a favorite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2015044">таңдаулылардан жою</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34754_2013078_2018766"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability of multiple authors, who are editing a shared document, to simultaneously see text and formatting changes made by co-authors as they add them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2013078">Real-time Co-authoring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2018766">Нақты уақытта бірігіп түзету</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34755_2013123_2018774"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that creates new and improved mobile browser views. Documents are displayed as big touchable tiles on the screen. Users can view their own documents, shared documents, or ones they follow. They can open documents or share the URL of a document with other users. Additionally, users can navigate to Mail, Calendar, People, and Sites to view sites that they follow and those promoted by their site administrator.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2013123">Touch Design</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2018774">Сенсорлы дизайн</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34756_2013318_2018800"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An app for the Windows Store designed for small groups of SharePoint users to enable them to perform basic tasks, such as provide access to team document libraries, site feeds, and project tasks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2013318">Sites app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2018800">Сайттар бағдарламасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34758_2013323_2786148"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A transfer of customer data from one system to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2013323">migration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2786148">миграция</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34759_2013324_2592343"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A product that provides additional functionality when used with a prerequisite underlying base product.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2013324">add-on</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2592343">қондырма</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3476_374309_615596"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A variable-length data type with a maximum of 8,000 bytes of binary data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="374309">varbinary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615596">Varbinary</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34761_2013325_2017644"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that is only available when a device is connected to the Internet so that the file’s data uses little space in the device’s storage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2013325">smart file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2017644">смарт-файл</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</