>Complete PC Backup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626316">Complete PC сақтық көшірме жасау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3644_116003_627515"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statistical measure of the amount by which a set of values differs from the arithmetical mean, equal to the square root of the mean of the differences' squares.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="116003">standard deviation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="627515">стандартты ауытқуы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3655_85228_627090"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hyphen that is used to prevent a hyphenated word, number, or phrase from breaking if it falls at the end of a line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="85228">nonbreaking hyphen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="627090">ажыратпас сызықшық</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3656_146969_615549"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Sub or Function procedure that has been declared as private by using the Private keyword in a Declare statement. Private procedures are available for use only by other procedures within the same module.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="146969">private procedure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615549">жеке іс рәсімі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3657_16207_2354546"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A characteristic of an object.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="16207">attribute</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354546">атрибут</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3659_319140_627125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ( character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319140">opening parenthesis</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="627125">ашылатын жай жақша</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3660_331773_615081"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An edition of a Microsoft word processing software program for creating Web, email, and print documents.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="331773">Microsoft® Office Word 2007</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615081">Microsoft® Office Word 2007</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3661_107780_1145230"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The extent to which an identifier, such as an object or property, can be referenced within a program. Scope can be global to the application or local to the active document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="107780">scope</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1145230">аумақ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3662_77222_626980"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that makes the screen more readable by people who have low vision by creating a separate window that displays a magnified portion of the screen.</descrip></descripGrp