operNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="36839_2722799_2746402"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Australia East region, located in New South Wales, within the Azure region taxonomy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2722799">Australia East</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2746402">Шығыс Австралия</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="36868_2093283_2105641"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component in Exchange 2013 that performs background tasks, such as mailbox database maintenance, mailbox processing, inference training, calendar repair, offline address book generation, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2093283">Time-Based Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105641">Уақыт негізіндегі көмекші</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="36869_2093284_2105642"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component in Exchange 2013 that performs background tasks, such as mailbox database maintenance, mailbox processing, inference training, calendar repair, offline address book generation, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2093284">Time-Based Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105642">Уақыт негізіндегі көмекші</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3687_187920_2221203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component of SQL Server that is responsible for managing the raw physical data in your database. For example, reading and writing the data to disk is a task handled by the storage engine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="187920">storage engine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2221203">қойманың қосалқы жүйесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="36870_2093285_2105635"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A time-based assistant (TBA) that parses emails and makes internal inferences based on them. Inferences are used to allow the system to gain insight into a user’s mailbox based on user patterns. Those inferences are then used to populate features for users, such as People View in Outlook Web App.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2093285">inference training</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105635">Қорытынды тренингі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="36871_2093286_2105637"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component that feeds data (such as mailbox messages) to the inference training assistant in batches. It controls performance by giving the inference training assistant a fixed amount of work to process at each interval.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2093286">inference training feeder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105637">Қорытынды тренингі арнасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="36872_2093287_2105643"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of OneNote for Android that allows you to create notes, audio notes, and picture notes right from your phone’s home screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2093287">widget</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2105643">виджет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termG