alUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37607_2145491_2338950"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chronological list of posts to monitor that match user-defined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2145491">stream</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2338950">хронологиялық тізім</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37612_2146201_2164881"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The full-screen pane in Office Universal Apps that shows a list of previous versions of the file that is currently open, and that provides the ability to preview and create a copy of an older versions or restore the current document to an older version.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2146201">History</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2164881">Журнал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37613_2147009_2150325"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The dimensions of circles in a bubble chart or a bubble map.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2147009">bubble size</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2150325">көпіршік өлшемі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37614_2147014_2150330"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A way of testing a mathematical model by entering known or closely estimated inputs for past events into the model to see how well the output matches the known results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2147014">hindcast</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2150330">ретроспективалық талдау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37615_2147075_2150331"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of identical, small charts with different values to compare them at the same time repeating horizontally within the borders of the chart.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2147075">horizontal multiples</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2150331">көлденең диаграммалар жиынтығы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><t