aticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38635_2247565_2250496"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action to express that you agree with similar feedback sent by someone else. Rather than resubmit the same feedback, you can tap "Upvote," which means that you agree with the feedback that has been previously submitted.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2247565">upvote</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250496">ұнату</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38636_2247566_2250497"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To agree with similar feedback sent by someone else. Rather than resubmit the same feedback, you can tap "Upvote," which means that you agree with the feedback that has been previously submitted.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2247566">upvote</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250497">ұнату</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38638_2247833_2250492"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The user accounts that are connected as a family. This feature allows adults to manage kids’ experiences within the kids’ user account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2247833">Microsoft family</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250492">Microsoft отбасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38639_2247838_3068276"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section in Windows Store containing the user ratings and reviews for a given app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2247838">Ratings and reviews</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3068276">Бағалаулар және пікірлер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38640_2410918_2556430"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A supplementary item that can be purchased by a user from within an app, and for use with that app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2410918">add-on</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2556430">қондырма</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38657_2249394_2257881"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view that displays web articles in a distraction-free layout that is optimized for their screen size.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2249394">reading view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2257881">оқу көрінісі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3866_318126_626319"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A language whose characters require ligation or shaping, such as a right-to-left language (Arabic, Persian, Hebrew, and Urdu) or certain South Asian languages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318126">complex script</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626319">күрделі таңбалар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38688_2254265_2338943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the MARS user interface, a logical course through a task in CRM, such as creating an account or qualifying a lead, leading to the conclusion of that task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2254265">path</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2338943">жол</term><termNote type="geograp