tion or contact by fixing its tile to the Start screen (the full screen view of Start) or Start menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259611">pin to Start</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436053">Бастау мәзіріне бекіту</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3888_25223_626172"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A communication line used for data transfer among the components of a computer system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25223">bus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="626172">шина</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38880_2259632_2262993"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Windows Store for Business and Education Store, to get apps and other digital goods into the hands of employees or students.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259632">distribute</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2262993">үлестіру</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38881_2259633_2263005"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode that allows using one app on your mobile screen while using a different app on a second screen that you're projecting from the mobile device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259633">dual-screen mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263005">екі экрандық режим</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38882_2259634_2262995"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that lets customers extend their gaming experience across multiple devices, play with other users, and show off scores and achievements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259634">game hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2262995">ойындар хабы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38883_2259635_2262996"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The default browser in Windows 10, which provides a more interoperable, reliable, and discoverable experience with advanced features including the ability to annotate on web pages, a distraction-free reading experience, and integration of Cortana. Also available on iOS and Android.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259635">Microsoft Edge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2262996">Microsoft Edge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38884_2259636_2262998"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The source location of files that are stored on OneDrive and not synced to the local device. This is different from other OneDrive files (just called "OneDrive"), where a copy is synced and stored locally as well as in the cloud.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259636">OneDrive (cloud only)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2262998">OneDrive (бұлт ғана)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38885_2259637_2262999"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user role within Windows Store for Business that allows the user to acquire apps from Windows Store for Business on behalf of his company.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259637">purchaser</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2262999">сатып алушы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38886_2259638_2263000"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view of a set of photos that displays them one at a time, sequentially.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259638">slideshow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263000">слайд көрсету</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38887_2259809_2262997"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section in the Settings app for Windows 10 desktop, containing network and Internet settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259809">Network &amp; Internet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2262997">Желі және интернет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38888_2259810_2263007"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section in the Settings app for Windows 10 Mobile, containing network and wireless (mobile) settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259810">Network &amp; wireless</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</term