evice into thickness of the line on the screen--the higher the speed, the thicker the line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2345583">Velocity Ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2348858">Жылдамдыққа тәуелді сызу қалыңдығы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40341_2345591_2346304"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To mark a location on a map by interacting directly with the map, instead of searching for an address or place name.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2345591">drop a pin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2346304">орынды белгілеу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40342_2345592_2346307"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A location marker that users can manually add to a map, so they can see it on the map and get additional location info and directions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2345592">pin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2346307">белгі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termN