et for your device that can be used by Windows, apps, and services when an exact location isn't available, such as on a desktop PC without GPS.​ ​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374312">default location</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378476">әдепкі орын</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41870_2370047_2429404"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A predetermined set of parameters that define the recurrence pattern and other details of auto-generated work orders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370047">agreement booking setup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2429404">тапсырыс беру құрылымы туралы келісім</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41878_2897507_2954657"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The unified security platform for preventative protection, post-breach detection, automated investigation, and response.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2897507">Microsoft Defender for Endpoint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2954657">MҚС</term><termNote type="geographical