></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43734_2467150_2469361"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Mixed Reality and Windows Holographic, an app type or app state in which the app renders as a flat window, not an immersive experience.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467150">2D view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469361">2D көрініс</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43735_2467157_2469368"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows Insider servicing release cadence that allows users to receive Windows new features only after the Fast ring participants.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467157">Slow ring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469368">Баяу сигнал</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43736_2467158_2469366"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows Insider servicing release cadence that allows users to receive Windows new features as soon as possible at the expense of possible bugs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467158">Fast ring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></t