1469_2539929"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows feature for controlling the cursor, mouse clicks, text input, and communication with the movement of your eyes, using an on-screen keyboard and other software controls together with eye-tracking hardware​.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2531469">eye control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2539929">көзбен басқару</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44981_2531623_2914000"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that presents data on who your players are and how they're engaging with Xbox features in your game. The reported statistics consider only the customers who are connected to Xbox Live, not all Xbox customers. The report only shows data if your game is published to Xbox or uses Xbox Live.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2531623">Xbox analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2914000">Xbox аналитикасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44982_2531624_2539930"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that allows users to change their Xbox avatars, start fresh with brand new ones, or take pictures of their avatars 