 to retrieve information about user, admin, system, and policy actions and events from Office 365 and Azure AD activity logs and to aggregates them into tenant-specific content blobs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2611874">Office 365 Management Activity API</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2615110">Office 365 басқару әрекеттеріне арналған API</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46353_2612185_2612728"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The consumer-friendly name for virtualization-based security (VBS). The VBS service in Windows 10 uses hardware virtualization features to create and isolate a secure region of memory from the normal operating system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612185">Core isolation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612728">Ядролық оқшаулау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46354_2612186_2612729"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of open tabs, including applications, files, pages, or websites, which can be saved together and re-opened together when you want to continue with that set of tabs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612186">set</term><termNote type="partO