 manage desktop related workloads, policy controls, user groups, software updates, device enrolment, as well as where they can update analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621937">Device Management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2624373">Құрылғыларды басқару</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46602_2621937_2692694"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The dashboard in the Microsoft 365 admin center where admins can manage desktop related workloads, policy controls, user groups, software updates, device enrolment, as well as where they can update analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621937">Device Management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2692694">Microsoft 365 құрылғыларды басқару</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46602_2690753_2624373"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The dashboard in the Microsoft 365 admin center where admins can manage desktop related workloads, policy controls, user groups, software updates, device enrolment, as well as where they can update analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2690753">Microsoft 365 device management</term><termNote type="par