ate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2685345">агрегат</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47582_2678644_2685346"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To combine multiple entities and behaviors that can be treated as a cohesive unit.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2678644">aggregate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2685346">агрегаттау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47589_2678875_2681149"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A data preparation artifact that ingests, transforms, integrates, and enriches big data by defining data source connections, ETL logic, refresh schedules, and more. In other words, a dataflow is a process that defines how the data should flow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2678875">dataflow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2681149">деректер ағыны</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4759_142263_615297"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The act of inserting font information into the publication or the compiled application. Once the font is embedded, the information becomes part of the publication or the application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="142263">font embedding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="615297">қаріп ендіру</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47597_2679308_2680578"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel function that searches a range or an array and returns an item corresponding to the first match, and if a match does not exist the closest match may optionally be returned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2679308">XLOOKUP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2680578">XLOOKUP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47598_2679309_2680581"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel function that searches a range or an array and returns the index of the first match, and if a match does not exist the closest match may optionally be returned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2679309">XMATCH</term><termNote type=