ffic passes through to reach nodes outside of the network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2785667">egress point</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2787016">шығу нүктесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49177_2785668_2787004"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft 365 tool that allows admins to search for sensitive, malicious, or misplaced data across Office 365, investigate what happened, and take the appropriate actions to remediate the spillage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2785668">Data Investigations (Preview)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2787004">Деректерді зерттеу (алдын ала қарау нұсқасы)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49178_2785669_2787011"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A transfer of sensitive data to an unauthorized entity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2785669">data spillage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2787011">деректерді жария ету</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSp