ce room as used in Microsoft Teams Rooms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2793577">Microsoft Teams Room</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795943">Teams бөлмесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49314_2794242_2795924"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A virtual conference room as used in Microsoft Teams Rooms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2794242">Teams Room</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795924">Microsoft Teams бөлмесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49314_2794242_2795943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A virtual conference room as used in Microsoft Teams Rooms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2794242">Teams Room</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795943">Teams бөлмесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49317_2794250_2795903"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu item in the Exchange admin center that allows users to modify the default connection filtering policy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2794250">Connection filtering</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795903">қосылымдарға сүзгі қою</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49318_2794253_2795902"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A policy that allows Exchange to match incoming messages against user-defined IP Allow and IP Block lists.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2794253">connection filter policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795902">қосылым сүзгілерінің саясаты</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49319_2794275_2795901"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI element in the Exchange admin center that takes a user to the Connection filter policy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2794275">Connection filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795901">қосылым сүзгісі</term><termNote t