 type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49808_2816676_2820320"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Teams, as part of Teams rollout done with Advisor for Teams, a workload is a set of features and settings that is used to deploy a specific collection of functions. Workloads are comprised of channels to complete the deployment of the functions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816676">workload</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2820320">жұмыс жүктемесі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49810_2816681_2820319"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To convert a phone number to a different format, by using a set of rules.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816681">translate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2820319">түрлендіру</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49811_2816684_2820302"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Microsoft 365 Admin Center, a specific network architecture design change that is recommended to improve user experie