D) for the Azure Active Directory for a particular tenant.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844105">directory ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849799">каталог идентификаторы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50290_2844110_2849792"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 connected experience that connects apps — Wunderlist, Facebook and Evernote, and Meetup — to the Outlook calendar so that the user can see all tasks, events, notes, etc., from these apps in the calendar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844110">Calendar apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849792">Күнтізбе бағдарламалары</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50291_2844113_2849812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 connected experience that allows users to subscribe to an external calendar within their Outlook calendar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844113">Interesting Calendars</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849812">Қызықты күнтізбелер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50292_2844117_2849813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 connected experience that adds the full address of a public place in the Location field when the user adds the name of this public place to a calendar item. Within an organization, it also suggests available meeting rooms, public places from Bing Maps, and other locations from the user's meeting history.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844117">Location suggestions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849813">Орналасқан жер ұсыныстары</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50293_2844118_2851555"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A color from the Outlook calendar color palette.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844118">burgundy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2851555">қызылкүрең</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50294_2844119_2851576"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One of the primary addit