un</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51108_2885547_2886372"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To stream the content of a user's device screen or a separate window to the screens of other users' devices, so these users could remotely see the screen of the user who shares it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2885547">share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2886372">бөлісу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51109_2885548_2886373"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An app that helps users be more productive at work, such as Office apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2885548">productivity app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2886373">өнімділік бағдарламасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51113_2886072_2886376"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The United States holiday celebrated on June 14 that commemorates the adoption of the flag of the United States.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2886072">Flag Day</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun<