</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53438_3045020_3045118"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app within Teams that allows users to capture images and videos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045020">Camera</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045118">Камера</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53441_3045240_3045340"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The root folder in Windows Explorer that shows recently used items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045240">Home</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045340">Басты қалта</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53442_3045241_3045341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of Windows Enterprise E3 that automatically keeps Windows and Office software up to date on enrolled endpoints.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045241">Windows Autopatch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045341">Windows авто түзету функциясы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53444_3045433_3046443"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The RPA mode where the automation is executed when users are in front of their computers. This is suitable when they want to automate tasks and processes at an individual level. The automation is often triggered manually whenever the user wants to run it. The process might require human interaction or decisions between steps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045433">attended</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046443">бақылаулы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53445_3045434_3046444"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A sequence of actions in a flow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045434">block of actions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046444">әрекеттер тобы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53446_3045435_3046445"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process of enabling users to interact with web applications and components through UI elements. UI elements describe uniquely the web components that the action is going to handle.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045435">browser automation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046445">браузерді автоматтандыру</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53447_3045436_3046446"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The AI Builder component that allows users to detect business cards and extract their information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045436">Business card reader</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046446">Визиттік картаны оқу құралы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53448_3045437_3046447"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A flow that is being called by the parent flow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045437">child flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046447">қосалқы ағын</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53449_3045438_3046448"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A qualified lead that can become an account, a contact or an opportunity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045438">converted lead</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046448">түрлендірілген ықтимал тұтынушы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53450_3045439_3046449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that improves models by raising confidence scores in AI Builder. Documents can be flagged by users and sent back to the training wizard queue for retraining if they didn't yield sufficient confidence scores when analyzed by AI Builder.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045439">feedback loop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046449">кері байланыс тізбегі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53451_3045440_3046450"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The prebuilt AI model in AI Builder that extracts key invoice data to help automate the processing of invoices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045440">Invoice processing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046450">Есеп-шот өңдеу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53452_3045441_3046451"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Desktop flow execution where automation is happening locally through the console on the user's machine, in an attended mode.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045441">local attended</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046451">жергілікті бақылаулы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53453_3045442_3046452"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group that allows you to organize multiple machines together to help distribute your automation workload and optimize productivity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045442">machine group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046452">компьютерлер тобы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53454_3045443_3046453"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power Automate app that allows you to connect your machine to the Power Automate cloud. It allows you to harness the full power of your robotic process automation (RPA).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045443">machine-runtime app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046453">компьютерлік орындалу ортасы бағдарламасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53455_3045444_3046454"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The custom AI model in AI Builder that can help expedite or automate business processes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045444">Object detection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046454">Нысанды анықтау</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53456_3045445_3046455"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A flow that calls another flow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045445">parent flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046455">негізгі ағын</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53457_3045446_3046456"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power Automate licensing plan that allows you to implement critical business processes with enough capacity to serve teams, departments, or the entire organization for an unlimited number of users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045446">per-flow plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046456">ағын бойынша жоспар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53458_3045447_3046457"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power Automate licensing plan that enables individuals to create unlimited workflows and business processes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045447">per-user plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046457">пайдаланушы бойынша жоспар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53459_3045448_3046458"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The agent that enables direct communication between a virtual desktop through Windows Remote Desktop or Citrix and the Power Automate for desktop app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045448">Power Automate agent for virtual desktops</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046458">Виртуалды жұмыс үстелдеріне арналған Power Automate агенті</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53460_3045449_3046459"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The browser extension add-on for enabling web automations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045449">Power Automate extension</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046459">Power Automate кеңейтімі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53461_3045450_3046460"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that securely saves your secure strings (e.g. passwords) and reuses them to automate applications with UI flows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045450">Sensitive text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046460">Құпия мәтін</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53462_3045451_3046461"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The prebuilt AI model in AI Builder that translates your text data in real time across more than 60 languages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045451">Text translation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046461">Мәтін аудару</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53463_3045452_3046462"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A comment with a Reply box. When people reply, users can see several comments connected together, showing a virtual conversation in the workbook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045452">threaded comment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046462">тізбекті комментарий</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53464_3045453_3046463"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The RPA mode where a designated computer or a server is set up to run the automation on behalf of a user. The whole automation process is run fully by Power Automate, and no interaction or decision is made by a human.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045453">unattended</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046463">бақылаусыз</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5348_232402_2770027"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The banner near the top of an open email message, appointment, contact, or task that indicates if a message has been replied to or forwarded and that provides the online status of a contact who is using instant messaging.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232402">InfoBar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2770027">ақпараттық тақта</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5348_2765047_2770027"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The banner near the top of an open email message, appointment, contact, or task that indicates if a message has been replied to or forwarded and that provides the online status of a contact who is using instant messaging.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2765047">infobar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termG