</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54077_3083705_3086032"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Viva feature that functions as a hub for employees to ask questions, find solutions, discover knowledge, and help coworkers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3083705">Answers</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3086032">Жауаптар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54078_3083710_3086049"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The argument in an Excel function that specifies the value that is redeemed per $100 face value.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3083710">redemption</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3086049">өтеу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54079_3083711_3086046"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The argument in Excel DOLLARDE function that specifies a number expressed as an integer part and a fraction part, separated by a decimal symbol.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3083711">fractional_dollar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig><