er">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54268_3094353_3094664"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A role assigned to experienced Power Apps makers to help others. The advisor will show as someone that can be contacted for help in the Power Apps Virtual Agent chat.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094353">advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094664">кеңесші</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54269_3094354_3094665"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A micro-app that uses enterprise data that can be sent as content in Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094354">card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094665">карта</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54270_3094355_3094666"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power Platform offering that enables you to deploy your small independent apps (mini-apps) into Teams chats, Microsoft Outlook emails, web chat, or third-party apps. Customers deploying new or updated business workflows enjoy increased efficiency and uptake by deploying apps in popular products such as Teams, as opposed to deploying entirely new sites or apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094355">Cards</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094666">Карталар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54271_3094356_3094667"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows app makers to add collaboration features (meetings, tasks, approvals, etc.) into apps built with Power Apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094356">Collaboration controls</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094667">Әрекеттестікті басқару элементтері</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54272_3094357_3094668"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Dataverse security configuration setting that allows users to manage the permission of users and teams to read, create, or write in secured columns. For example, the System Administrator column security profile gives full access to all secured columns.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094357">column security profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094668">баған қауіпсіздігі профилі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54273_3094358_3094669"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An extra layer of security that helps detect and mitigate some types of web attacks such as data theft, site defacement, or the distribution of malware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094358">content security policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094669">мазмұн қауіпсіздігі саясаты</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54274_3094359_3094670"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A special type of URI that encodes the actual resource content, instead of just pointing to it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094359">data URI</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094670">деректердің URI идентификаторы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54275_3094360_3094671"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pipeline that eliminates much of today's application lifecycle management (ALM) complexity by bringing ALM automation into the product and making it accessible to all makers, admins, and developers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094360">deployment pipeline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094671">орналастыру үдерістерінің тізбегі</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54276_3094361_3094672"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An environment to build and test with Power Apps, Power Automate, and Microsoft Dataverse. It can be created by users who have the Power Apps Developer Plan.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094361">developer environment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094672">әзірлеуші ортасы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54277_3094362_3094673"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power Apps feature that accelerates the getting started process by taking existing content (e.g., a picture of your paper form, a screenshot of a design you like, a PPT, a PDF, or a Figma design file) and converting them into a working Power App with UI and data without requiring the maker to learn how to build an app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094362">express design</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094673">жедел дизайн</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54278_3094363_3094674"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of governance capabilities, found in the Power Platform Admin Center that will simplify, automate, and streamline IT administration of the Power Platform.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094363">Managed Environments</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094674">Басқарылатын орталар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54279_3094364_3094675"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The annual event sponsored by Microsoft dedicated to Microsoft Power Platform products including Power Apps, Power Automate, Power BI, Power Pages, and Power Virtual Agents.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094364">Power Platform Conference</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094675">Power Platform конференциясы</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54280_3094365_3094676"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Power Apps connector available to Premium License Plan subscribers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094365">premium connector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094676">премиум қосқыш</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54281_3094366_3094677"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power Platform feature that shows how much finance and operations storage your organization is using compared with how much its license entitles it to.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094366">storage capacity reporting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094677">сақтау сыйымдылығы туралы есеп</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54282_3094367_3094678"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A data type in Power Fx that can hold any data structure, complex or simple. It can't be used directly and requires explicit conversion to a data type. Fields in records in an untyped object can be accessed using the dot notation, and existence of fields is only verified at runtime.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094367">untyped object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3094678">жіктелмеген нысан</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54283_3095195_3095310"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protection of data in use by performing computation in a hardware-based Trusted Execution Environment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3095195">confidential computing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3095310">құпия есептеу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54285_3095197_3095311"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The free global learning event on Data, Analytics and AI for data professionals that features a keynote session and more than 200 breakout sessions delivered by Azure Data engineering, partner organizations, and community leaders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3095197">Data Platform Virtual Summit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kk"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3095311">Data Platform Virtual Summit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">KAZ</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Proper